{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_zch5fqqvsobhqcjkomktiqpeehjrwelvqfkulk52hz7acpwdyx2q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01XjaJ5DsSiVgvKz2MSNLcqb","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"SxmsjomtdkiWGWyoVDnAOU","description":"Read all text on Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];for(const id of ['0:1','1:2']){const p=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);out.push('=== '+p.name);const walk=(n,d)=>{let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' '+n.name+' ['+Math.round(n.x||0)+','+Math.round(n.y||0)+' '+Math.round(n.width||0)+'x'+Math.round(n.height||0)+']';if(n.type==='TEXT')s+=' :: '+n.characters;if(n.fills&&n.fills.length&&n.fills[0].type==='SOLID'&&n.type!=='TEXT'){const c=n.fills[0].color;s+=' fill#'+[c.r,c.g,c.b].map(v=>Math.round(v*255).toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('')}out.push(s);if('children' in n)n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1))};p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));}return out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":970,"cache_read_input_tokens":7915,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":970,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5489a460-d4f1-4b38-985e-dd706316f652","uuid":"76a28bae-7139-43fc-9752-cfda2252ee1e","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:49:08.357Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01XjaJ5DsSiVgvKz2MSNLcqb","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01XjaJ5DsSiVgvKz2MSNLcqb","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 3:2 Start Here · Brief [0,0 1440x2210] fill#ffffff\n  FRAME 3:3 Header [64,64 1312x145]\n    TEXT 3:4 LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2 [0,0 182x19] :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT 3:5 Deniz Arslan — 3D artist portfolio [0,31 1312x52] :: Deniz Arslan — 3D artist portfolio\n    TEXT 3:6 Design a two-page personal portfolio for a 3D artist and sculptor: a work page with three projects and an about page with skills and contact. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference. [0,95 1312x50] :: Design a two-page personal portfolio for a 3D artist and sculptor: a work page with three projects and an about page with skills and contact. Desktop web, 1440 wide, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME 3:7 How to work [64,257 1312x249]\n    TEXT 3:8 How to work [0,0 147x35] :: How to work\n    TEXT 3:9 1. Build exactly the 2 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in page order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The two brand colors and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii, elevation and the page grid, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives no Button or Text Field: the source has neither (every action is a text link). Design the header, footer, link style, current-page state and every content block as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the portrait photo and the icons from 04 · Media. The three project images are not supplie